OL,3,GNEWSAGas firm had 'toxic' and
OL,4,A'unprofessional' culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe culture at Jersey's only gas
OL,7,Fcompany was "unprofessional" and
OL,8,F"toxic", a former human resources
OL,9,Fworker has told the court.
OL,11,FKimberley Patterson said she had been
OL,12,Fbrought in as the chief people officer
OL,13,Fin September 2021 by the then chief
OL,14,Fexecutive officer Jo Cox, who told her
OL,15,Fthe company was "in a bit of a mess"
OL,16,Fand had a "toxic environment".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
