OL,3,GNEWSAGas firm had 'toxic' and
OL,4,A'unprofessional' culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatterson is giving evidence in the
OL,7,Ftrial of Island Energy which pleads not
OL,8,Fguilty to a combined health and safety
OL,9,Fcase. Gas workers Neil Armstrong, John
OL,10,FWright and Lee Ward, also deny 10
OL,11,Fcounts of gross negligence
OL,12,Fmanslaughter.
OL,14,FThe HR worker said when she began
OL,15,Fworking at Island Energy, she was
OL,16,Fsurprised by how people communicated.
